  "title": "Almondy Warmth Cookies",
  "description": "I was pleasantly surprised when my late night sugar munchies concoction tasted fabulous. They&#39;re cake-like; barely crisp around the edges and so soft inside that the center will literally melt in your mouth. Mom called them the best cookies she&#39;d ever tried. You should try them.",
